    "rationale":  "Class 3 aggregate adjudication. The bundle observed/indexable position sum is 148,842,798, but the raw filing anchors 2025 total investments at fair value at 88,037,380 in table 154 row 8 and table 227 row 4. The SOI grand total in table 188 row 8 is 94,254,388 only because it includes the money market funds row of 6,217,008 shown in table 188 row 3; that row is outside the 88,037,380 investment-fair-value anchor. The observed value therefore materially over-covers the filing anchor. The exact residual does not localize to a single source row from the available row-disposition evidence, so localization is false, but the anchor disagreement proves a real aggregate data error."
